== Effects ==
* Isaac has a 50% chance to explode when he takes damage, similarly to if he used {{i|Kamikaze!}}.
** The explosion deals 185 damage and uses most of Isaac's bomb synergies.
** The explosion does '''not''' cause additional damage to Isaac, as the explosion occurs during Isaac's invincibility frames.

== Notes ==
* Causes {{Machine|Devil Beggar}} and {{Machine|Hell Game}} to become essentially unplayable, as any damage that could trigger Swallowed M80 will likely cause Isaac to explode, killing them.
* {{dlc|nr+}} Causes {{Machine|Blood Donation Machine}}s and {{Machine|Confessional}}s to act as if they were destroyed from the explosion despite surviving and functioning normally, resulting in extra coin and {{e|Red Heart|text=Heart}} drops.
* The explosion cannot be triggered by {{R|Curse Room}} or {{R|Sacrifice Room}} spikes.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box}} / {{t|Swallowed M80}}: Having either of these effects/another copy of the trinket raises the chance to trigger an explosion to 100%.
* {{i|Pyromaniac}}: Heals half a red heart on triggered explosion, rendering Isaac invincible on earlier stages if combined with the above synergy.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Kamikaze!}}: The damage received from Kamikaze cannot trigger the trinket, and the activation of the trinket applies a cooldown to Kamikaze (as if it was used).
* {{c|Tainted Magdalene}}: Explosions will kill enemies before Tainted Magdalene's “hug” attack, preventing heart drops from killing enemies on contact from being guaranteed.

== No Effect ==
All bomb upgrades affect Swallowed M80 except the following:
* {{I|Bob's Curse}}
* {{I|Fast Bombs}}
* {{I|Ghost Bombs}}
* {{i|Mr. Mega}}
* {{I|Rocket in a Jar}}
* {{I|Scatter Bombs}}
* {{I|Sticky Bombs}}

